 end="00:09.480">come </span><span begin="00:09.480" end="00:09.900">party </span><span begin="00:09.900" end="00:10.140">with </span><span begin="00:10.140" end="00:11.100">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.790" end="00:13.080"><span begin="00:11.790" end="00:12.030">A </span><span begin="00:12.030" end="00:13.080">little</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.800" end="00:15.840"><span begin="00:13.800" end="00:14.070">Can </span><span begin="00:14.070" end="00:14.220">I </span><span begin="00:14.220" end="00:14.490">look </span><span begin="00:14.490" end="00:14.790">into </span><span begin="00:14.790" end="00:15.120">your </span><span begin="00:15.120" end="00:15.840">eyes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.900" end="00:18.960"><span begin="00:15.900" end="00:16.080">I </span><span begin="00:16.080" end="00:16.320">can </span><span begin="00:16.320" end="00:16.620">tell </span><span begin="00:16.620" end="00:16.830">that </span><span begin="00:16.830" end="00:16.980">you're </span><span begin="00:16.980" end="00:17.790">high</span><span begin="00:17.790" end="00:17.790">, </span><span begin="00:17.790" end="00:18.960">too</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.580" end="00:25.020"><span begin="00:20.580" end="00:20.880">That's </span><span begin="00:20.880" end="00:21.420">okay </span><span begin="00:21.420" end="00:22.110">baby</span><span begin="00:22.110" end="00:22.110">, </span><span begin="00:22.110" end="00:22.440">'cause </span><span begin="00:22.440" end="00:22.560">I </span><span begin="00:22.560" end="00:22.800">just </span><span begin="00:22.800" end="00:23.160">wanna </span><span begin="00:23.160" end="00:23.610">party </span><span begin="00:23.610" end="00:23.880">with </span><span begin="00:23.880" end="00:25.020">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.860" end="00:30.810"><span begin="00:25.860" end="00:26.250">'Cause </span><span begin="00:26.250" end="00:26.430">when </span><span begin="00:26.430" end="00:26.640">we </span><span begin="00:26.640" end="00:27.060">hit </span><span begin="00:27.060" end="00:27.210">the </span><span begin="00:27.210" end="00:27.540">peak</span><span begin="00:27.540" end="00:28.860">, </span><span begin="00:28.860" end="00:30.810">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.610" end="00:34.350"><span begin="00:32.610" end="00:32.820">I </span><span begin="00:32.820" end="00:33.120">just </span><span begin="00:33.120" end="00:33.420">wanna </span><span begin="00:33.420" end="00:33.900">party </span><span begin="00:33.900" end="00:34.140">with </span><span begin="00:34.140" end="00:34.350">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.080" end="00:38.250"><span begin="00:37.080" end="00:37.530">All </span><span begin="00:37.530" end="00:38.250">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.070" end="00:45.570"><span begin="00:41.070" end="00:41.610">Someone </span><span begin="00:41.610" end="00:41.880">hold </span><span begin="00:41.880" end="00:42.000">my </span><span begin="00:42.000" end="00:42.660">phones </span><span begin="00:42.660" end="00:43.020">'cause </span><span begin="00:43.020" end="00:43.320">I </span><span begin="00:43.320" end="00:43.770">can</span><span begin="00:43.770" end="00:43.800">’</span><span begin="00:43.800" end="00:43.860">t </span><span begin="00:43.860" end="00:44.160">hold </span><span begin="00:44.160" end="00:44.340">my </span><span begin="00:44.340" end="00:45.570">tongue</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.310" end="00:51.510"><span begin="00:47.310" end="00:47.700">'Cause </span><span begin="00:47.700" end="00:47.880">if </span><span begin="00:47.880" end="00:48.030">I </span><span begin="00:48.030" end="00:48.240">get </span><span begin="00:48.240" end="00:48.450">too </span><span begin="00:48.450" end="00:48.870">drunk </span><span begin="00:48.870" end="00:49.710">baby</span><span begin="00:49.710" end="00:49.740">, </span><span begin="00:49.740" end="00:50.010">then </span><span begin="00:50.010" end="00:50.040">I</span><span begin="00:50.040" end="00:50.100">’</span><span begin="00:50.100" end="00:50.220">m </span><span begin="00:50.220" end="00:50.790">gonna </span><span begin="00:50.790" end="00:51.090">ruin </span><span begin="00:51.090" end="00:51.180">the </span><span begin="00:51.180" end="00:51.510">fun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.900" end="01:01.230"><span begin="00:54.900" end="00:55.350">It's </span><span begin="00:55.350" end="00:55.560">not </span><span begin="00:55.560" end="00:55.710">your </span><span begin="00:55.710" end="00:56.670">problem</span><span begin="00:56.670" end="00:56.670">, </span><span begin="00:56.670" end="00:56.850">it's </span><span begin="00:56.850" end="00:57.330">because </span><span begin="00:57.330" end="00:57.420">I'm </span><span begin="00:57.420" end="00:57.900">seein' </span><span begin="00:57.900" end="00:58.080">too </span><span begin="00:58.080" end="00:58.800">much</span><span begin="00:58.800" end="00:59.640">, </span><span begin="00:59.640" end="01:01.230">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.530" end="01:05.700"><span begin="01:01.530" end="01:02.220">Sorry </span><span begin="01:02.220" end="01:02.460">if </span><span begin="01:02.460" end="01:02.580">I </span><span begin="01:02.580" end="01:03.120">give </span><span begin="01:03.120" end="01:03.450">you </span><span begin="01:03.450" end="01:05.700">PTSD</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.600" end="01:09.690"><span begin="01:06.600" end="01:06.990">But </span><span begin="01:06.990" end="01:07.110">I </span><span begin="01:07.110" end="01:07.380">just </span><span begin="01:07.380" end="01:07.710">wanna </span><span begin="01:07.710" end="01:08.160">party </span><span begin="01:08.160" end="01:08.430">with </span><span begin="01:08.430" end="01:09.690">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.370" end="01:13.890"><span begin="01:11.370" end="01:11.820">All </span><span begin="01:11.820" end="01:13.890">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.920" end="01:15.990"><span begin="01:13.920" end="01:14.430">Because </span><span begin="01:14.430" end="01:14.580">you </span><span begin="01:14.580" end="01:14.850">make </span><span begin="01:14.850" end="01:15.060">me </span><span begin="01:15.060" end="01:15.990">happy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.150" end="01:20.310"><span begin="01:18.150" end="01:18.690">That's </span><span begin="01:18.690" end="01:20.310">right</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.370" end="01:23.130"><span begin="01:20.370" end="01:21.030">I </span><span begin="01:21.030" end="01:21.300">wanna </span><span begin="01:21.300" end="01:21.390">come </span><span begin="01:21.390" end="01:21.480">and </span><span begin="01:21.480" end="01:21.900">party </span><span begin="01:21.900" end="01:22.140">with </span><span begin="01:22.140" end="01:23.130">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.020" end="01:27.600"><span begin="01:25.020" end="01:27.600">Tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.630" end="01:29.670"><span begin="01:27.630" end="01:28.140">Because </span><span begin="01:28.140" end="01:28.320">you're </span><span begin="01:28.320" end="01:28.800">makin' </span><span begin="01:28.800" end="01:28.890">me </span><span begin="01:28.890" end="01:29.670">feel</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.950" end="01:33.120"><span begin="01:31.950" end="01:33.120">Alright</span></p></div></body></tt>